### 2. Tables
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Active orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Kitchen queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Reports overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lấy danh sách bàn
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Tạo bàn thử nghiệm
POST {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "T01",
  "name": "Bàn 01",
  "capacity": 4
}


### Mở phiên ăn cho bàn T01
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableId": 1
}
